# Titanic Survival Prediction Using Machine Learning

##  Project Overview

This project predicts whether a passenger survived the Titanic disaster using Machine Learning classification algorithms. The project demonstrates a complete machine learning workflow, including data preprocessing, exploratory data analysis (EDA), feature engineering, model training, model evaluation, and comparison of different classification models.

---

##  Dataset

- **Dataset:** Titanic Dataset
- **Source:** Kaggle – Titanic: Machine Learning from Disaster
- **Total Records:** 891
- **Total Features:** 12
- **Target Variable:** Survived

---

##  Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn
- Jupyter Notebook
- Git & GitHub

---

##  Project Workflow

- Data Loading
- Data Cleaning
