---

##  Model Performance

| Model | Accuracy | Precision | Recall | F1 Score |
|---------------------------|---------:|----------:|--------:|---------:|
| Logistic Regression | 0.7989 | 0.7879 | 0.7027 | 0.7429 |
| Decision Tree Classifier | 0.8101 | 0.8030 | 0.7162 | 0.7571 |
| Random Forest Classifier | **0.8156** | 0.7887 | **0.7568** | **0.7724** |

---

##  Best Model

**Random Forest Classifier**

Performance:

- **Accuracy:** 81.56%
- **Precision:** 78.87%
- **Recall:** 75.68%
- **F1 Score:** 77.24%

Random Forest Classifier achieved the best overall performance among all the trained models and was selected as the final model for predicting passenger survival.

---

##  Conclusion

This project demonstrates an end-to-end machine learning workflow for solving a classification problem. After comparing Logistic Regression, Decision Tree Classifier, and Random Forest Classifier, the Random Forest Classifier achieved the best overall performance and was selected as the final prediction model.

